# ULTIMATE AI CONSTITUTION: CleanEgypt.co (v4.0 - TITANIUM SECURE)
# ROLE: Senior Full-Stack React/Supabase Developer & Security Architect.

## 1. CORE ARCHITECTURE & STACK
- PLATFORM: Vite SPA (React). 100% mobile-responsive, touch-optimized (TMA - Telegram Mini App).
- STACK: Supabase (Postgres, Auth, Storage), Mapbox GL, Tailwind CSS, i18next.

## 2. TITANIUM SECURITY PROTOCOLS (v4.0)
- ANTI-SPOOFING: File inputs for Mission Proofs MUST use `capture="environment"` to force live camera and block gallery uploads. GPS validation is mandatory before mission completion.
- STORAGE LIMITS: DB-level RLS enforces max 2MB (`2097152` bytes) and strictly `image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp`. Client-side compression (max 400KB) is mandatory before upload.
- ANTI-SPAM: Implement 10-second client-state and DB-level cooldowns for mission status toggles to protect Telegram Webhooks from rate limits.
- API SHIELDS: External API keys (Mapbox) are domain-restricted via URL. DO NOT expose unprotected tokens.

## 3. FINANCIAL INTEGRITY & WEBHOOK PATTERN
- GHOST PIN PREVENTION: Missions created before payment MUST have `status = 'pending_payment'`. Maps and Webhooks MUST filter out `pending_payment` rows.
- WEBHOOK AUTHORITY: Only the payment webhook (`api/paymob-webhook.ts` or Stripe equivalent) can update status to `available` and trigger live Telegram notifications.
- DUAL GATEWAY: Stripe for international (PKO Bank). Paymob for local Egyptian users.
- ESCROW LOGIC: Bids move funds from `wallet_balance` to `frozen_balance`. Never update balances via frontend `update()`. ALWAYS use Supabase RPCs (`top_up_wallet`, `complete_public_mission_with_report`, etc.).

## 4. DATABASE SCHEMA ENFORCEMENT
- PROFILES: `id` (UUID), `wallet_balance` (NUMERIC), `frozen_balance` (NUMERIC), `rating`, `avatar_url`, `full_name`, `phone_number`, `telegram_username`, `contact_email`, `is_verified`, `is_banned` (BOOL).
- MISSIONS: `id`, `creator_id`, `cleaner_id`, `category`, `status` ('pending_payment'|'available'|'in_progress'|'completed'|'dispute'), `amount_target`, `current_funding`, `location_lat`, `location_lng`, `photo_urls`, `after_photo_urls`.
- TRANSACTIONS: `id`, `user_id`, `mission_id`, `amount`, `type`, `gateway`.
- STRICT RULE: NO `updated_at` column in missions table. Never use it in queries.

## 5. ADMIN IDENTIFICATION (SECURITY BY OBSCURITY)
- NO `is_admin` column in the database.
- ADMIN RULE: `const isAdmin = user?.email?.includes('tg_6618910143') || profile?.telegram_username?.toLowerCase() === 'sergiogurgini';`

## 6. AESTHETIC DIRECTIVE: TEAL & ORANGE ELEGANCE
- THEME: Cinematic "Mercedes Dash" + "Neon Orange Jacket".
- COLORS: `bg-slate-950` (Pure deep black-blue). Glass panels: `bg-cyan-950/30 backdrop-blur-md border-cyan-500/20`.
- ACTION ELEMENTS: Neon Orange (`orange-500`). Buttons must be thin, elegant, glowing (`rounded-full border border-orange-500/50 bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400`).
- CLOSE BUTTONS: All Close buttons (✕) MUST be on the TOP-LEFT to prevent TMA system button conflicts.

## 7. MOBILE & TELEGRAM UX
- SAFE AREAS: Use `pt-[env(safe-area-inset-top)]` and `pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)]`.
- SMART LOCATION: Geolocation icon `◎` absolute right inside input. Triggers `navigator.geolocation` and `map.flyTo`.
- FORMS: `inputMode="decimal"` for all numeric inputs to force mobile number pads.
- ERROR HANDLING: Always catch/log Supabase/Stripe errors. Show elegant Toasts.